  "statement": "**C2 · Stretch · PyTorch — a region network as tensors.** Write the natural edge–AND–OR network of A4 as three weight matrices and three bias vectors. Give every shape, evaluate a batch of one million random points in [−3,3]², and check against direct Python evaluation on 1,000 of them plus points on each edge and vertex. Report time per point and agreement; distinguish a sampled check from proof of exact equivalence.",
